 "intro_zh": "青岩古镇建于明洪武十年(1378年)，原为军事要塞 。古镇内设计精巧、工艺精湛的明清古建筑交错密布。镇内有青岩教案遗址、赵状元府第、平刚先生故居、红军长征作战指挥部等景点。",
 "intro_en": "Qingyan Ancient Town was built in the 10th year of Hongwu in the Ming Dynasty (1378) and was originally a military fortress. The ancient town is densely packed with ancient buildings from the Ming and Qing dynasties with exquisite designs and exquisite craftsmanship. In the town, there are scenic spots such as Qingyan Missionary Plan Site, Zhao Zhuangyuan's Mansion, Mr. Ping Gang's Former Residence, and the Red Army's Long March Operation Headquarters.",
 "intro_en_source": "machine_translation",
